"*grid* -- The Earth geoid grid. Coordinates are latitude and longitude in "
"degrees. Units are in meters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/datasets/earth_geoid.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.datasets.earth_geoid.load_earth_geoid:44
